<title>POLAND: POLAND UPS T-BILL OFFER TO PLN 4 BLN IN FEBRUARY.</title>
<headline>POLAND UPS T-BILL OFFER TO PLN 4 BLN IN FEBRUARY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish treasury raised its</p>
<p>monthly offer of treasury bills to four billion zlotys in</p>
<p>February from 3.6 billion in January, the ministry said.</p>
<p>Poland will not offer 8-week or 39-week paper next month.</p>
<p>TENTATIVE FEBRUARY T-BILL OFFER SHEDULE (in mln zlotys)</p>
<p>		   Feb 3	 Feb 10	Feb 17	 Feb 24</p>
<p>  13-week	 400	   300	   300	    300</p>
<p>  26-week	 100	   200	   200	    200</p>
<p>  52-week	 500	   500	   500	    500</p>
<p>   TOTAL	 1000	  1000	  1000	   1000</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
